WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.480 align:start position:19%
truck rolled in, headlights off, parking
by the payphone.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:12.040 align:start position:19%
And I understood all at once. The man
getting out was me.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:16.280 align:start position:19%
Older, 30 years older.
He looked at the payphone, then at me,

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:22.360 align:start position:19%
and mouthed three words,
"Do not pick up."

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:26.880 align:start position:19%
The voice was counting again. 10 9
8 The older me shook his head, pointing

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:29.480 align:start position:19%
at the receiver.
I dropped the phone, it swung against

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:32.840 align:start position:19%
the brick, the counting stopped
mid-number, like a needle ripped off a

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:37.160 align:start position:19%
record.
The older me climbed into his truck and

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:40.720 align:start position:19%
drove into the desert with Subscribe for
more true horror stories.

